---
code: field.name.kebab-case
description: Convert camelCase field names to kebab-case (userName -> user-name)
default-enabled: false
---

# Mainstream kebab-case: acronym boundaries are split (URLValue -> url-value).
# Matches Jackson's KebabCaseStrategy as well as .NET, Newtonsoft.Json, Rails,
# Pydantic and lodash.
field.name=groovy:```
    return tool.toKebabCase(it.fieldName())
```
